1
00:00:00,611 --> 00:00:03,651
(Sheldon:)What a beautiful job Stephanie did.

2
00:00:03,823 --> 00:00:06,163
(Sheldon:)I might have gone
with a mattress suture instead...

3
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:08,615
(Sheldon:)...but you can't argue with her results.

4
00:00:08,786 --> 00:00:10,366
(Sheldon:)It's a shame it won't scar.

5
00:00:10,538 --> 00:00:15,088
(Sheldon:)The war wound
is a time-honored badge of masculinity.

6
00:00:16,085 --> 00:00:19,505
(Leonard:)I can't remember a time
when you weren't talking.

7
00:00:20,465 --> 00:00:24,305
(Sheldon:)Just for the record, my efforts to establish
you as the alpha male were not aided...

8
00:00:24,469 --> 00:00:27,429
(Sheldon:)- ...by you bursting into tears.
- I did not burst into tears.

9
00:00:27,597 --> 00:00:30,437
(Leonard:)- My eyes just got a little watery.
- Watery?

10
00:00:30,975 --> 00:00:34,105
(Leonard:)She stuck a needle into my hand.

11
00:00:34,729 --> 00:00:37,609
Hey, how's my big crybaby?

12
00:00:38,524 --> 00:00:39,734
(Leonard:)I didn't cry.

13
00:00:40,234 --> 00:00:42,574
(Steph:)Okay, I'm just teasing you.

14
00:00:42,737 --> 00:00:43,987
(Steph:)But, yeah, you did.

15
00:00:45,156 --> 00:00:48,196
(Steph:)It's all good. What do you say
we get you home, put you to bed?

16
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:50,117
Oh. Are you still gonna spend the night?

17
00:00:50,286 --> 00:00:52,996
(Steph:)Uh, no. I think that you
probably need to rest.

18
00:00:53,164 --> 00:00:58,024
(Sheldon:)She's right. As long as you're vomiting,
coitus is contraindicated.

